              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ogikorre esahaani n'ebibindi eby'okukwatiramu obubbani. Ogibumbire ebbakuli n'ejaagi eby'okwiturramu ebihongwa eby'ekyokunywa; ebi byona, obikole omu zaabbu enungi mali.",
          "type": "text",
